@host = http://localhost:5222

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "user@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### Login (copy accessToken into @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "user@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Profile
GET {{host}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Securities issuers
GET {{host}}/api/securities-issuers?page=1&limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Company clients
GET {{host}}/api/company-clients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Countries
GET {{host}}/api/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- Accounting (per company client) ----------------
@company = 1

### Chart of accounts
GET {{host}}/api/companies/{{company}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Load standard Australian chart of accounts
POST {{host}}/api/companies/{{company}}/accounts/load-default
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bank accounts (with statement / ledger balances)
GET {{host}}/api/companies/{{company}}/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create bank account (creates its ledger account 090, 091…)
POST {{host}}/api/companies/{{company}}/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Cuenta corriente CBA", "bankName": "Commonwealth Bank", "bsb": "062-000", "accountNumber": "12345678" }

### Import statement (CSV/OFX/QFX). Optional form field "mapping" = CsvMapping JSON; use /statements/preview first
POST {{host}}/api/companies/{{company}}/bank-accounts/1/statements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cba.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

27/11/2026,"-110.00","TELSTRA PREPAID","+1890.00"
26/11/2026,"+2000.00","Transfer from client","+2000.00"
--b--

### Pending transactions
GET {{host}}/api/companies/{{company}}/bank-accounts/1/transactions?status=Unreconciled
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reconcile (lines are GST-inclusive and must add up to the transaction)
POST {{host}}/api/companies/{{company}}/bank-transactions/1/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lines": [ { "accountId": 25, "amount": 110.00, "taxType": "GST" } ] }

### Undo reconciliation
DELETE {{host}}/api/companies/{{company}}/bank-transactions/1/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
